摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Backend for AI coding agents on CloudBase — database, auth, functions via Plugin, Skills & MCP.","id":"gh:988892963","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"CloudBase-AI-Toolkit","slug":"TencentCloudBase/CloudBase-AI-Toolkit","topics":["agent-skills","ai","aicoding","claude-code","cloudbase","cursor","database","dsh-plugin","mcp","mcp-server","miniprogram","postgresql","supabase","tencent","vibe-coding","web"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Backend for AI coding agents on CloudBase — database, auth, functions via Plugin, Skills & MCP."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# CloudBase AI Toolkit"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**AI writes the code. CloudBase runs the backend.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The CloudBase integration layer for AI coding tools: Plugin installs the stack, Skills steer how cod"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"e is written, MCP operates databases, functions, storage, and deploys from chat."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**English** · 简体中文 · [Docs][docs] · [Changelog][changelog] · [Issues][github-issues-link]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[][npm-link]\n[][github-stars-link]\n[][github-forks-link]\n[][github-issues-link]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[][cnb-link]\n[][deepwiki-link]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Recent updates"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**v2.37.x** (2026-11)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Diagnostics: opaque backend errors become next-step guidance; function CLS failures carry RequestI"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"d and two parallel self-check paths; code updates say when Status is still running\n- Safety / CloudR"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"un: bulk deletes fail closed when the client cannot confirm; CloudRun target paths must stay inside "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"the project and cannot point at host credential directories\n- PostgreSQL: migrationVersion must be a"},{"id":"p10s5","text":" real calendar timestamp; migrationDetail only needs a version; several false-positive path and SQL "},{"id":"p10s6","text":"guards are relaxed\n- Ecosystem: Codex plugin variant in Agent Plugins format; Qianwen skill-market p"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ackages; China-site WorkBuddy connector package"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**v2.36.x** (2026-10)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- MCP Apps: three panels — environment, environment usage and deployment result — are on by default;"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" set `CLOUDBASE_MCP_UI=off` to hide them\n- Safety: deletes, destructive SQL and the matching `callCl"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"oudApi` delete actions pause for a confirmation that names the target; a credential-shaped argument "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"gets one delta check (length plus a sha256 fingerprint, never the value itself)\n- Environment: the u"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"sage panel gains a metrics view (QPS, invocations, errors, timeouts, MySQL and CloudRun load) with h"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"uman names, and MySQL provisioning is retired from the tool surface\n- Onboarding: every `initialize`"},{"id":"p12s7","text":" response carries `instructions` with the first read-only call to make; the remote setup docs now le"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"ries `instructions` with the first read-only call to make; the remote setup docs now lead with OAuth"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[Releases][changelog] · [Star][github-stars-link] · Watch → Releases"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## What it is"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"AI IDEs (Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, CodeBuddy, and others) are strong at generating code. What usua"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"lly blocks you is the backend: schemas, permissions, functions, storage, environments, and release."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"CloudBase is Tencent Cloud’s AI-native all-in-one backend (database, storage, auth, cloud functions,"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" Cloud Run, and more). This repo is the Toolkit that connects that backend to AI tools:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Piece | Role |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| **Plugin** | Installs MCP Server, Agent Skills, and Hooks together—less per-IDE wiring |\n| **Agent"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" Skills** | Scenario skills (Web / Mini Program / database / auth / functions, etc.) toward workable"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" CloudBase practice |\n| **MCP** | Login, query and change data, manage functions and hosting, read l"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ogs—from the conversation |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"This repository ships the npm package `@cloudbase/cloudbase-mcp`, Skills, and AI plugins."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"You still need your own CloudBase environment, and you should confirm sensitive actions the AI propo"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ses. The Toolkit provides capability and path—not judgment."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Related repositories"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Publishing and sync repos live under TencentCloudBase. Directly related to this Toolkit:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Repository | Contents | Typical entry |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| CloudBase-AI-Toolkit (this repo) | MCP Server source; marketplace source for Claude Code / Codex |"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" `npx @cloudbase/cloudbase-mcp@latest` |\n| dsh-plugin | DeepSeek Harness plugin (`@cloudbase/dsh-plu"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"gin`): MCP bridge + DB/Storage/Auth panel | `dsh plugin add @cloudbase/dsh-plugin` |\n| cloudbase-plu"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"gin | Open Plugin Spec publish repo (CI-synced): MCP + Skills + Hooks | `npx plugins add TencentClou"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"dBase/cloudbase-plugin` · CNB fallback: `npx plugins add https://cnb.cool/tencent/cloud/cloudbase/cl"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"oudbase-plugin.git` |\n| cloudbase-sites-plugin | Sites plugin: Vite Web create & deploy | `npx plugi"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"ns add TencentCloudBase/cloudbase-sites-plugin` · CNB: `https://cnb.cool/tencent/cloud/cloudbase/clo"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"udbase-sites-plugin.git` |\n| cloudbase-skills | Agent Skills collection | `npx skills add TencentClo"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"udBase/cloudbase-skills` · CNB: `https://cnb.cool/tencent/cloud/cloudbase/cloudbase-skills.git` |\n| "},{"id":"p24s10","text":"skills | Per-skill install catalog (also on skills.sh) | `npx skills add tencentcloudbase/skills --s"},{"id":"p24s11","text":"kill <name>` |\n| awesome-cloudbase-examples | CloudBase examples and case studies | Browse / clone e"},{"id":"p24s12","text":"xamples |\n| OpenVibeCoding | Vibecoding template on CloudBase | Use as a project starter |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Prefer Plugin for the full stack; Skills alone when you only need knowledge constraints. For marketp"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"lace IDEs use this repo—do not also run `npx plugins add` on the same tool."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Fastest way to get started"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Copy this AI prompt into your AI IDE. The agent reads `skill.md` and completes the setup:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Pick one default path for your tool (Plugin / MCP)"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Your tool | Suggested path |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Claude Code / Codex (native marketplace) | Add this repo as marketplace, then install the `cloudba"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"se` plugin (plugin docs) |\n| Open Plugin Spec tools | `npx plugins add TencentCloudBase/cloudbase-pl"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"ugin` |\n| CodeBuddy / WorkBuddy / Doubao / MiniMax Code / DeepSeek Harness / ZCode / Kimi (built-in)"},{"id":"p32s4","text":" | Use the IDE's built-in CloudBase plugin or connector; for CodeBuddy you can also install via plug"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"in marketplace |\n| Other MCP-capable IDEs | MCP config only (below) |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"> Already using CloudBase CLI? `tcb ai` sets up MCP and Skills too (docs)."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"#### Plugin"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Details and IDE differences: AI plugin docs."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Capabilities"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"After setup, the AI can do typical backend work in your environment (confirm critical steps):"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- **Database**: PostgreSQL and document DB, data models, CRUD, permissions and security rules\n- **Co"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"mpute**: author, deploy, invoke, and debug cloud functions / Cloud Run\n- **Auth & storage**: login m"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"ethods, object storage, permission linkage with data\n- **Release & ops**: static hosting / Mini Prog"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"ram publish; inspect logs and redeploy"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Fits Web, WeChat Mini Programs, and backend services. Platform overview: CloudBase docs."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- Node.js v18.15.0+\n- A CloudBase environment\n- An AI tool that supports Plugin / Skills / MCP"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
